      "content": "It is not crazy to long for the cessation of pain; that yearning is the deepest part of your broken heart speaking. The desire to be with him again is a profound reflection of how deeply you loved, and that love is real. Please, if you are having thoughts of ending your life, reach out for immediate help. You can call or text 988 in the US and Canada, or dial 111 in the UK.",
      "source": "target",
